,"name":"Amiya","text":"All right... I appreciate it."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_016_medic","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#4","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"About the Doctor..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_016_medic","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#4","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Medic","text":"Don't worry, Amiya. All the vital signs are stable now."},{"t":"line","name":"Medic","text":"I'll do one more inspection, just for you."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_016_medic","name2":"char_002_amiya_1#4","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Thank you... Thank you very much!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_016_medic"}},{"t":"line","name":"Medic","text":"Mhm. Breathing is slightly shallow, but blood pressure is normal. There should be no cause for concern."},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.6,"r":255,"g":150,"b":13,"afrom":0,"rfrom":0,"gfrom":0,"bfrom":0,"fadetime":0.1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Enemy/e_atk/e_atk_blunt_n"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.5,"xstrength":3,"ystrength":4,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"fadetime":0.2,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"background","a":{"image":"bg_indoor_1","width":1,"height":1,"fadetime":0.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#6"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"...!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_016_medic"}},{"t":"line","name":"Medic","text":"..."},{"t":"line","name":"Medic","text":"Are you awake?"},{"t":"line","name":"Medic","text":"Amiya, it's a success! The Doctor has woken up!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#3"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Doctor...?"},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"I'm so happy... Doctor..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_016_medic"}},{"t":"line","name":"Medic","text":"Ah, careful! You mustn't do that..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.5,"r":1,"g":0.5,"b":0.5,"afrom":0,"rfrom":0,"gfrom":0,"bfrom":0,"fadetime":0.1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"fadetime":0.1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.5,"xstrength":10,"ystrength":12,"vibrato":15,"randomness":90,"fadeout":true,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_016_medic"}},{"t":"line","name":"Medic","text":"Don't try to move yet. Your body still hasn't fully adapted to this."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Doctor...?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":1}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#3","focus":-1}},{"t":"decision","options":["Who... are you?"],"values":["1"]},{"t":"predicate","refs":["1"]},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#6"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Ah, Doctor... It's me..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"It's me, Amiya."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"We've come to rescue you."},{"t":"decision","options":["...Who... am I...?"],"values":["1"]},{"t":"predicate","refs":["1"]},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"You..."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"You're a member of Rhodes Island, just like us..."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"...as well as my partner."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"...Dr. {@nickname}."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"You're the most important person to me."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Doctor... you don't remember?"},{"t":"decision","options":["...Can I trust you?","...","I see... Pleased to meet you, Amiya."],"values":["1","2","3"]},{"t":"predicate","refs":["1"]},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"..."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"I understand. I know this is a bit much to take in right now."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"I don't expect you to remember everything right away, and I'm not asking you to trust me right now."},{"t":"predicate","refs":["2"]},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Dr. {@nickname}, do you really not remember me at all...?"},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"..."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Even if that's the case... I won't give up."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"We've already sacrificed so much, just to find you..."},{"t":"predicate","refs":["3"]},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#6"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Ah, um, hello."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#4"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"I, I don't know how to put this, but so many things have changed from before."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"That includes me as well."},{"t":"predicate","refs":["1","2","3"]},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"However, you'll always be the most important person to me, Doctor. No matter what happens, this will never change."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"So that's why, please... give me a little more time."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"However little it might be..."},{"t":"decision","options":["......"],"values":["1"]},{"t":"predicate","refs":["1"]},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#1","name2":"char_016_medic","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Medic","text":"Does the doctor... really have amnesia?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#1","name2":"char_016_medic","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"..."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"I'm sure everything will be fine if we give Doctor some space..."},{"t":"decision","options":["Where is this..."],"values":["1"]},{"t":"predicate","refs":["1"]},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"It's safe here—"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"fadetime":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.5,"xstrength":8,"ystrength":10,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Battle/b_char/b_char_rockexplo"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"stopmusic","a":{"fadetime":0.8}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"delay":0.6}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#6"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Huh? What's happening—"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#6","name2":"char_013_riop","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Heavily-Armed Man","text":"Amiya, we've got a problem!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#6","name2":"char_013_riop","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Heavily-Armed Man","text":"Someone broke into the facility!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"afrom":0,"rfrom":0,"gfrom":0,"bfrom":0,"fadetime":0.6,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"delay":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playmusic","a":{"intro":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta2_180603/m_dia_escape_intro","key":"Sound_Beta_2/Music/beta2_180603/m_dia_escape_loop","volume":0.8,"crossfade":1.5,"delay":0.5}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.5,"xstrength":8,"ystrength":10,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1002_nsabr_1"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"afrom":0,"rfrom":0,"gfrom":0,"bfrom":0,"fadetime":0.1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Battle/b_char/b_char_rockexplo"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"fadetime":1.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"delay","a":{"time":0.7}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#6","name2":"char_013_riop","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Heavily-Armed Man","text":"The way they're dressed... they don't look like Ursus soldiers!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_1002_nsabr_1"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":1,"xstrength":4,"ystrength":4,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_gen_soldiersrun"}},{"t":"line","name":"Reunion Member","text":"..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_013_riop"}},{"t":"line","name":"Heavily-Armed Man","text":"What's the meaning of this?!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"dialog","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.7,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.02,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_sp_ballista"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.25,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.6,"xstrength":5,"ystrength":8,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_013_riop"}},{"t":"line","name":"Heavily-Armed Man","text":"They're attacking! Amiya, they're heavily equipped with weapons!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0.7,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.02,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Enemy/e_atk/e_atk_arrow_h"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/Enemy/e_atk/e_atk_arrow_h"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"r":0.95,"g":0.95,"b":0.95,"fadetime":0.25,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.6,"xstrength":5,"ystrength":8,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_016_medic"}},{"t":"line","name":"Medic","text":"Aaaahh!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Be careful, everyone! Take cover, and protect Doctor!"},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"These outfits... are they from the Reunion Movement? But how is that possible..."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Guards, prepare for battle!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_013_riop"}},{"t":"line","name":"Guard","text":"Roger!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{}},{"t":"cmd","c":"camerashake","a":{"duration":0.5,"xstrength":8,"ystrength":10,"vibrato":30,"randomness":90,"block":false}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":1,"r":255,"g":255,"b":255,"afrom":0,"rfrom":0,"gfrom":0,"bfrom":0,"fadetime":0.1,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"playsound","a":{"key":"Sound_Beta_2/AVG/d_sp_ballista"}},{"t":"cmd","c":"blocker","a":{"a":0,"fadetime":1.5,"block":true}},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_013_riop"}},{"t":"line","name":"Guard","text":"Curses... Are they after the Doctor?!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1","name2":"char_013_riop","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"No... Nobody else should know about the Doctor being here."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7","name2":"char_013_riop","focus":1}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Are you able to reach Kal'tsit?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1","name2":"char_013_riop","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Guard","text":"I'm not sure why, but the equipment isn't working!"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"...Someone has cut off our communications."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Have we been discovered by the Ursus government?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1","name2":"char_013_riop","focus":2}},{"t":"line","name":"Guard","text":"What do we do now?"},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1"}},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"Kal'tsit won't be able to command the battle as we had originally planned."},{"t":"line","name":"Amiya","text":"..."},{"t":"cmd","c":"character","a":{"name":"char_002_amiya_1#7"}},{"t":"li